  "problem": "The minimum time it takes an electrician to fix a power outage is $20$ minutes, and the maximum time is $160$ minutes. Assuming that the time it takes to fix the power outage is uniformly distributed, what is the probability that a random power outage fix takes more than $30$ minutes but less than $60$ minutes?",
